Exact accumulation for OpenCPMD. Default off (-D__EXACT_ACC).
Against 062582b7cfd832d36f88f504cd08e4ead42eb404.

Apply-side products and the atomic guess no longer follow the rank split.
exact_apply_rr sums the projector index for one G at a time, so the
result does not depend on how many G vectors share a rank.
The gamma atomic guess builds one replicated matrix and diagonalizes
it on the parent. The distributed Lanczos start is rank-dependent.

